eptember came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 39% of normal in September to October and 47% in October to November. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 25% of normal and May to June at 180%. Grid 12179 had its driest year in 1954 at 59% of normal.</p>"}
